{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）與女友李炘頤（Alina）昨日於峇里舉行浪漫海外婚禮，正式結束9年愛情 …</p><p></p>\n<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）與女友李炘頤（Alina）昨日於峇里舉行浪漫海外婚禮，正式結束9年愛情長跑。多位圈中好友親身飛抵當地見證這場人生大事，當中兄弟團成員在晚宴致辭時情緒激動。現場更意外曝光了一段不為人知往事讓眾人當場淚崩。\n</p>\n<h2>邱士縉李炘頤峇里海外婚禮場面浪漫</h2>\n<p>昨日10月25日天公作美，這對新人在峇里順利舉行海外婚禮，新娘子穿上親自參與設計白色婚紗進場時已經眼濕濕，兩人在宣讀誓辭一刻更雙雙激動落淚。到了晚宴環節，現場特別安排煙花匯演，一對新人在璀璨夜空下浪漫共舞，兄弟團成員Edan、Jer及Jeremy隨後驚喜合唱《My Apple Pie》送上甜蜜祝福，唱畢後更與新郎合體大跳《Bad》，加上Fatboy即場跳舞助興，將全場氣氛推向最高潮。</p>\n<h2>兄弟團成員收到李炘頤親筆手寫卡</h2>\n<p>為了答謝一眾遠赴峇里出席婚禮親友，這對新人提早親手撰寫感謝卡送給每位來賓。Anson Lo隨後在社交平台公開展示收到實體卡片，並清晰影到卡上寫有「我哋一起經歷太多太多！多謝永遠 sweet，永遠細心的你。以後有咩唔開心、或者開心都好，你叫一聲，我哋一定出嚟陪你！Thanks for coming」等字句。據悉新郎哥因為工作行程緊密，圓婚後完全沒有時間留在當地度蜜月，已經火速搭飛機趕回香港準備開工。\n</p>\n<h2>組合隊友Jeremy致辭重提初見經過</h2>\n<p>出道至今與新郎感情極為深厚並組成「巨龍與豬仔」組合好兄弟Jeremy，在晚宴致辭環節時回憶起三人相識經過，忍不住感觸哭成淚人。他在台上哽咽表示：「記得當初第一次見 Alina 嘅時候都係着一條黑色嘅禮服裙，覺得 Alina 好靚，今晚 Alina 著番同一條裙，就好似去返嗰晚初初認識咁，但係呢幾年大家已經歷咗好多，成長咗，Alina 同阿 Stanley 好照顧我，覺得自己好似佢哋個細佬。」</p>\n<h2>網民洗版式留言祝賀MIRROR成員新婚</h2>\n<p>大批粉絲及網民在社交平台得知婚禮順利舉行後，紛紛湧入兩人社交帳號留言送上祝賀。不少粉絲對於兄弟團特意飛往外地見證這份真摯友情感到相當激動，紛紛留言表示「見到你哋班兄弟齊齊整整真係好感動」、「恭喜晒兩人終於跑完9年愛情長跑」，亦有網民針對新郎哥馬上回港開工一事表示心痛，直指「剛結完婚就要返工真係辛苦」、「希望之後可以補番個靚靚蜜月旅行」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301116483529317_2228327686adf2dddecf2a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5354.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301116483529317_2228327686adf2dddecf2a.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301116998799308_18800722446adf2de2c5b7e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5357.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301116998799308_18800722446adf2de2c5b7e.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301118048337055_5692861486adf2ded7334a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5355.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301118048337055_5692861486adf2ded7334a.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301119237226073_13205544956adf2df95bee8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5358.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301119237226073_13205544956adf2df95bee8.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930112072911939_808557776adf2e080a2a6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5356.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17930112072911939_808557776adf2e080a2a6.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301122301790247_11556185896adf2e17d2279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_5360.JPG/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301122301790247_11556185896adf2e17d2279.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：大會提供）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%8e%e7%82%98%e9%a0%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">李炘頤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b5%b7%e5%a4%96%e5%a9%9a%e7%a6%ae/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">海外婚禮</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%82%b1%e5%a3%ab%e7%b8%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">邱士縉</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3530629\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 26 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:32.893546+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1398,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:59:12.142569+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:25.282800+00:00","content_hash":"3bba0039e83f44d9e06cebc4d06afca79c9cac3366f424010eb08f9a1d54895e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}